# The battle sign (mic-sign): first temple battle with Jian alone (test stats, one kill per action, so the
# battle lasts several rounds). A every 20 frames, a shot every 100 frames: command input, actions,
# later rounds' command input, to check the sign and anything sharing its tiles.
include boot_from_save
include cheats_strong
include warp6
wait 270
shot sign00
press A 3
wait 17
